{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras/68b3a8b87a2800ceb5e524c19e071de1.avif?t=1762822506\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;To all the seventeen-year-olds with endless possibilities.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a male-oriented visual light novel (Galgame) themed around youth and romance. After being promoted to the second year of high school, you\u2019re informed that the school will stop admitting new students. Your childhood friend, Kokoro Natsuka, is determined to prevent the school from closing down. Just as you\u2014an unmotivated person\u2014are about to be reluctantly dragged into her plan by the optimistic her, an unexpected incident occurs\u2026 You have to rewind the seemingly endless end of summer, make different choices and actions, and save your relationship with her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras/10ce85df85576aae3ebb3e0b7570ab46.avif?t=1762822506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras_big/10ce85df85576aae3ebb3e0b7570ab46.webp?t=1762822506 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pure love work with a single heroine and a single ending, the story has approximately 120,000 characters\u2014equivalent to more than one volume of a light novel. It plans to include over 20 sets of original CGs, more than 10 sets of SD illustrations, one original theme song and one image song, full voice acting for key female characters (in both Chinese and Japanese), a pure love Happy End, and a sweet After Story\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras/9066e408aa730039caad02d00cae4843.avif?t=1762822506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras_big/9066e408aa730039caad02d00cae4843.webp?t=1762822506 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo covers the prologue with around 15,000 characters, introducing the main characters and story clues. It takes about 30 minutes to experience, including 4 CG illustrations, 2 SD illustrations, the original theme song (OP), and Kokoro Natsuka\u2019s original image song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras/5a4f4ee7c8c6e05895ccc1c960b9c7d5.avif?t=1762822506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras_big/5a4f4ee7c8c6e05895ccc1c960b9c7d5.avif?t=1762822506 width=1560 height=894 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras/3f9b6b9302898da9e641c74363aeb16b.avif?t=1762822506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras_big/3f9b6b9302898da9e641c74363aeb16b.avif?t=1762822506 width=1560 height=894 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras/cdee3743357dd1d6f9c5eadd7a13e71d.avif?t=1762822506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras_big/cdee3743357dd1d6f9c5eadd7a13e71d.avif?t=1762822506 width=1560 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras/3909683f99bc44bec2cd9e012e5e401b.avif?t=1762822506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/extras_big/3909683f99bc44bec2cd9e012e5e401b.webp?t=1762822506 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7535\u6c14\u767d\u5170 is a doujin circle brand focusing on &quot;youth light novel ADV&quot;. We are committed to creating delightful and touching works, and hope to grow together with everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production Staff &amp; Resource Credits (updated periodically) \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script:\u4e5d\u65e5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >painting\uff1a\u95ef\u95ef</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >painting: \u6e90\u4ee3\u7801</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game UI\uff1a\u5323\u4e2d\u732b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphic Design\uff1a\u6c50\u94f6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV Director\uff1aPhichaz\u3001\u98d8\u96f6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice actors\uff1aw\u5c0f\u7483\u3001\u5fc6\u8fb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice actors\uff1aTOPKINGCREAM\u3001TKCaseinStudio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music provided\uff1a\u9ed1\u8000\u8000\u7684\u7d20\u6750\u5c0f\u5c4b\u3001Henry_28\u3001[\u4e4c\u9e26Producer]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background art\uff1a\u307f\u3093\u3061\u308a\u306efanbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manager\uff1aMika</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4167400?t=1762822506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4167400?t=1762822506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167400/7b9b233eb2416a75d932938418ffbe993fd20729/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762822506",